  "question": {
    "text": "A cylinder of compressed gas that bears no label is supposed to contain either ethane or ethene. Combustion of the sample shows that 16 <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math> of the gas require 48 <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math> of oxygen for complete combustion. This shows that the gas is"
  },
