  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><munder><mrow><munder><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>vol</mtext></mrow></munder></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn><mtext>c</mtext><msup><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><mrow><munder><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow></munder></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></munder><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>  <br/>Now we have <math><mn>16</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>48</mn></math>  <br/>or y = 4 <br/>Hence, the hydrocarbon is <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> ."
